{"version":1,"content":"<p>剛剛，特朗普自曝——自己曾威脅要逮捕一家AI巨頭的CEO，因為他用AI做了些壞事，而且可能是惡意的。他説的是誰，答案已經呼之欲出。年初，特朗普威脅會給他帶來「刑事後果」。9月，他公開點名「我已經阻止他做壞事」。另外，特朗普還曾私下承認「一周前我還覺得他是國家安全威脅」。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585740.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.118898+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T06:36:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"2a73886dfc5c21596dc571b581c867d2e127329c8ed27c317078a5b5d7338a3e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}